  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Development in Montenegro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will establish a tailored approach to design, launch, and operate a Green Jobs Training Centre dedicated to upskilling and reskilling the labor force, while promoting energy-efficient practices across the energy sector and other relevant industries in Montenegro. Particular emphasis will be placed on addressing the unique needs of the underdeveloped northern region, including the coal-dependent area of Pljevlja.</narrative>
  </description>
